Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些特有的征兆  它们预示着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these specific omens -- they're prelude to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The four horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哪个骑士是骑红马的呢  - 战争骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And which one rides the red horse?  - War.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  你们杀不死战争骑士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill war, kiddos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戒指  那个戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring. The ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到刀刃上淋淋滴落的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop thinking about it --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就一直忍不住的在想它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since you saw it dripping off the blade of that knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.65,0:00:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲜血  鲜血  鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood, blood, blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是什么伪君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not some junkie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个迪恩和萨姆的故事真是烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that the "Dean and Sam" Story sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是什么有趣的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不是在娱乐大众\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是胡扯瞎掰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a river of crap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会让大多数人被送去精神病院\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would send most people howling to the nuthouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想去拯救多少人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people do you have to save?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每天怎么能睡得安稳呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you get up in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是太累了  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tired, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}First date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉塞尔  今晚我过得真开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a really good time tonight, Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能再见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周日怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunday, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.61,0:01:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want to be alone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过情人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}on valentine's day...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又一次这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  我  不想让你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- I -- I don't want you to think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是那种人  那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the type of person who --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是我应该道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I should apologize --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很欣赏你此刻拙劣的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect the crap out of you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.21,0:02:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的脖子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是我咬了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I bit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉很爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊  我曾经如此的孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! I've been so alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要你  拉塞尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you, Russell --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.82,0:02:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你的全部融入我的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you... inside me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.57,0:03:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你发现尸体的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the one who found the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时到处都是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was blood everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外还有一些器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...other stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得当时爱丽丝已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Alice was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:35.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是拉塞尔没死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Russell wasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也奄奄一息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he was, mostly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了  他还有一点点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except... he was still sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咀嚼动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewing a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个人怎么可能做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do two people even do that --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,互相撕咬直到死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat each other to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a really good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:04:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近一些日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the last few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你注意到她有什么反常表现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice her acting erratically?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是她是不是有点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, did she seem...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反常好斗的敌对情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unusually hostile, aggressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.73,0:04:11.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱丽丝滴酒不沾  甚至从不骂人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice never drank, never even swore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个好姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如我说的  这个好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm talking, like, a nice girl --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还留着她的誓盟戒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like she still had her promise ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你明白我的意思的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个处女啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a virgin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚决抵制婚前性行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No premarital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经还纳闷她是怎么能做到的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to wonder how she did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  不做那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know, didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是她数月里第一次约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her first date in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她当时那么的兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然  他们俩个都很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, they were both pretty excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有异常电场  也没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No EMF, no sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似既不是幽灵和恶鬼附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost possession and demonic possession
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两者都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}are both probably out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你让我压哪一个啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. That's where I was puttin' my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:04:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  然后怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.89,0:05:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙角那儿  你没见着那些尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the coroner's -- you didn't see these bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这俩人互相撕咬咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, these two started eating
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就这么一直咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and they just... kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们的胃塞满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, their stomachs were full.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像吃感恩节晚餐那么撑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like -- like... thanksgiving-dinner full.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是相依为命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about co-dependent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经去看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we got our feelers out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚也干不了什么别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much more we can do tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来查查资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna go through some files.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想去哪儿就去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go ahead and get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧  释放你的饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Unleash the kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天早上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我上哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  今天是情人节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's valentine's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最喜欢的节日  记起来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favorite holiday, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老管它叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what do you always call it --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自由浪子的圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, unattached drifter christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... be that as it may...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许今年没那个心情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm not feeling it this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你不去逛满是单身女人酒吧了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not into bars full of lonely women?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不去了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像狗不吃屎了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's when a dog doesn't eat --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是真的觉悟了这样做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when you know something's really wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常明显的圣人般的担心又准时出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remarkably patronizing concern duly noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么不对的  开工还是干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's wrong. We gonna work or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真烦  搞什么飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch! No me gusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.59,0:06:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你审查过这个吗  小吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been proofing this thing, Jimbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么又在看手机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you are not checking your cellphone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你像被她栓了狗链一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, she's got you on a leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没被栓着  布拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not on a leash, brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她只是想知道我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just wants to know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想知道你在她掌控之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just wants to know that you're whipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布拉德  等我两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brad, just give me two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是这个项目的负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the project leader on this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让我的副手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna half-ass it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被一个才遇见一个礼拜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause my wingman has gone mental
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.73,0:06:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贱人迷住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over some chick he met, like, a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么乱七八糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是必须得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just I had to --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆  你爱工作多过了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't choose work over me, Jim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  珍妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't, Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小吉  无意冒犯  但说实话老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimbo, due respect, but honestly, bro --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底要怎样  吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是不管我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like whatever we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有些事会把我们分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in life is always gonna keep us apart --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在工作  在家  甚至睡觉的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work, family, sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许咱们该一起去监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now prison, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.11,0:07:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我有个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I have an idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样我们才能在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we can stay together...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.97,0:07:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:18.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马雷探员  你总是适时出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Marley, you just can't stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你又接到了一宗情侣自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you tagged another double suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我刚把他们装起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just finished closing them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔曼医生  这是我搭档  克里夫探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Corman, this is my partner, special agent Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  克里夫探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做完了初步尸检\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've finished my prelims.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我摘下那些器官送去做毒理检验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled the organ sets and sent off the tox samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  你不介意我们看看尸体吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. You mind if we take a look at the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是就像我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like I said --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们最新鲜饱满的部分都已经装盒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their...good-and-plenties are already tupperwared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙交给前台的马蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the keys with Marty up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了  绅士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please, gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开之后记得冷冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refrigerate after opening...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做我的爱人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my valentine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些心脏都有一样的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}These hearts both have identical marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是某个字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like some kind of letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个是以诺克符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's Enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说那种天使抓痕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like angel scratches?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像咱俩肋骨上刻的那东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think it's like the tagging on our ribs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, it's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  圣詹姆斯医疗中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, room 31-c, basement level...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地下一层  31-C房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. James medical center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  我看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就  挂电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hang up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  萨姆  这些是天使的记号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, Sam. These are angelic marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想另外那些心脏上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine you'll find similar marks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也会有类似的记号\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the other couples' hearts as well --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到底是什么  那记号什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are they? I mean, what do they mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是结合记号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a mark of union.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对男女本来想进行交配的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man and woman were intended to mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那记号是谁弄上去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but who put them there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类称他们为"丘比特"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your people call them "Cupid."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.09,0:10:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的神话中记载丘比特属于低等天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}What human myth has mistaken for "Cupid"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is actually a lower order of angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严格来说  他们是小天使  第三阶天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically it's a cherub, third-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cherub?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:50.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  他们无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数量很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are dozens of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说那个裹着尿布飞来飞去的小胖孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the little flying fat kid in diapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们并没有失禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not incontinent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.65,0:10:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  不论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:10:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what you're saying --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  有一个丘比特在人间作乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is a Cupid has gone rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他再次杀戮之前  我们必须阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have to stop him -- before he kills again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你碰巧知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you just happen to know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他喜欢这里大波斯菊是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he likes the cosmos at this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是人类进行繁殖的中心地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a nexus of human reproduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对吻合丘比特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exactly the kind of --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择传播情欲地点的标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}...of garden the Cupid will come to -- to pollinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不饿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不饿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛  我不饿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你不吃了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're not gonna finish that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说坐在同一侧的那对情侣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the same-side-of-the-booth couple over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们后面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.31,0:12:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我困住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have him tethered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显露真身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manifest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢哟  救援马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, help is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就来了哟  就来了哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是丘比特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要  - 要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.35,0:13:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要的要的要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是开战了吗  我们要开打了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a fight? Are we in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们的  问好方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is... their handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不喜欢  - 没人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't like it. - No one likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.03,0:13:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么可以帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的目标  那些被你标记的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your targets -- the ones you've marked --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在互相屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're slaughtering each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  小裸男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, birthday suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你满世界乱飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you been flittin' around,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用你那个毒箭对人们乱射一气\N{\fnArial\fs30}popping people with your poison arrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}making them murder each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we don't know is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that I --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道说什么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是得过去个人  劝劝他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should somebody maybe... go talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  好主意  好好表现  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's a good idea. Give 'em hell, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是故意要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't mean to, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要伤害你的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}...hurt your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱情对我来说不是一个词能描述的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love is more than a word to me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱爱情  我爱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love love. I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是不对的  就让我错下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if that's wrong, I don't want to be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  好的  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.51,0:15:03.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚正在我指定的地点巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just on my appointed rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论那之后我的目标是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever my targets do after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟我没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我只是听从了命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was following my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  兄弟  阅读我的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, brother. Read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快读我的思想  你就会明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read my mind. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说的是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地  谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jiminy christmas. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你刚刚说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, you said --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你只是听从了命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were just following orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上天的命令  傻瓜  上天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, silly. Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么上天会关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does heaven care 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈里和萨莉是否相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}If harry meets sally?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一般情况下来说  他们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mostly they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某种血缘关系  某种命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, certain bloodlines, certain destinies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就像你们一样  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, like yours.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  约翰和玛丽·温彻斯特的结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the union of John and Mary Winchester --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天造的一对  最优先的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very big deal upstairs, top priority arrangement. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你撮合了我们的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that you fixed-up our parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我  但是  也算是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not me, but...yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wasn't easy, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始他们不能相互忍受对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, they couldn't stand each other at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:15:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是当我们把事处理好后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when we were done with them --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们成了完美的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-完美  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perfect?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  但是  命令说的很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but... the orders were very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和萨姆需要出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and sam needed to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的父母是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents were just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天造地设的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}A match made in heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:20.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd he go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你把他惹恼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you upset him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他惹恼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upset him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚给了丘比特一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just punched a Cupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打的是一个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I punched a dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要不要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么把你惹火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's been up with you lately or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你们要听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to hear about
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.94,0:16:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他一些怪异的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other weird ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莱斯特·芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lester Finch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.87,0:17:10.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看他的诊断记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled his records.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位先生之前大概有400磅重 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like this gentleman used to weigh 400 pounds or so,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到他做了一次胃绕道手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till he got a gastric bypass,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这让他的体重下降明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brought down his weight considerably.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是昨晚  由于某些原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then for some reason, last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没有节制的吃奶油蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He decided to go on a twinkie binge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么他是死于猛吃蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he died from a twinkie binge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他松开了肚子上的腰带之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after he blew out the band around his stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把胃填得直到破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He filled it up till it burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他不能再咽下食物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he can no longer swallow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他开始用一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started jamming the cakes down his gullet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一把马桶刷\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把蛋糕塞进他的咽喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a toilet brush,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像他吃了一颗炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he was ramrodding a cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你准备怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you make of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:51.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that it was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一件非常罕见的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very peculiar thing to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙没有被丘比特标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, this guy was not marked by Cupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他的死确实很可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his death is definitely suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚看了一下警察的记事簿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I just went through the police blotter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And counting him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从星期三起有8起自杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's eight suicides since wednesday
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,19起连环杀人案\N{\fnArial\fs30}AND 19 O.D.S --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这远远高于一般的恶灵致死案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's way out of the seasonal batting average.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有一个固定模式的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if there's a pattern here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就不仅仅是关于爱情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ain't just love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会远远超出我们所想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hell of a lot bigger than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好  我们10点见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right. I'll see you in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  我知道你是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could smell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.87,0:19:35.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那恶魔到底为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does a demon got to do with this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:38.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我也没有头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是的  我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.17,0:19:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来打开她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's crack her open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看还有什么更坏的事在等着  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the worst that could happen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到底是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个人类的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于开始露出点眉目了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  什么叫露出点眉目了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what about that makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你什么时候开始吃东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when did you start eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的饥饿  其实就是条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hunger -- it's a clue, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-关于什么的  - 关于什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座小镇不是遭到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This town is not suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱恨情仇的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}From some love-gone-wrong effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是肚子饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's suffering from hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.32,0:20:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该说是饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starvation, to be exact --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,具体点就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Specifically...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Famine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Famine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四骑士之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-as in the horseman?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真  真是棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-t-that's freaking great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来饥荒就是肚子饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought famine meant starvation,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像  你所知道的  想吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like as in, you know, food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.05,0:20:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不仅仅是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not just food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是每个人都会对一些事物非常的饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, everyone seems to be starving for something --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:21:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,性  关注  毒品  爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sex, attention, drugs, love...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就可以解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么丘比特选了那对小情侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The puppy-lovers that Cupid shot up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小天使让那俩人对爱情产生渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cherub made them crave love,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥荒接着到来  然后使他们对爱情发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then famine came, and made them rabid for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  那么你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.23,0:21:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  小天使什么时候开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, since when do angels
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悄悄的开始啃白色城堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secretly hunger for white castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的皮囊  吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my vessel -- Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他开始对肉狂热了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His, uh, appetite for red meat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也被饥荒之魔触碰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has been touched by famine's effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  饥荒席卷了整个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, famine just rolls into town
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后每个人都变的疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everybody goes crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随后饥荒之魔跨着黑色的骏马\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And then will come famine riding on a black steed."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踏遍整个大陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He will ride into the land of plenty..."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.09,0:22:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万物皆因骑士之饥而被吞噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}"...and great will be the horseman's hunger,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只因他的饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}For he is hunger."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.61,0:22:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的饥饿弥漫在空气中  笼罩在人群里\N{\fnArial\fs30}"His hunger will seep out and poison the air."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.73,0:22:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥荒饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Famine's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他得吞食那些被害者的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must devour the souls of his victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:22:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  那个手提箱里装的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's what was in the briefcase --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.16,0:23:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个奶油公子的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The twinkie dude's soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法派出他的恶魔手下们照看着饥荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer has sent his demons to care for famine,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂好他  为了确保他时刻准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}To feed him, make certain he'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.02,0:23:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好征服整个大陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}To march across the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.22,0:23:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特  那个皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam winchester -- the vessel --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.35,0:23:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在哪  - 医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - At the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们打了一架  但被他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought, but he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.61,0:23:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从他身上拿到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this off him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.25,0:23:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:24:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但要先吃午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}After lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.07,0:24:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  食物在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.56,0:24:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个爱吃奶油蛋糕的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who loves cream cake so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.02,0:24:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的灵魂在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is his soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  不  那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. No. The --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特把箱子抢走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester took the case from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.31,0:24:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃  他拿着那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he had the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.18,0:24:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再去找一个  十分钟就能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get another. I-I won't be 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.42,0:24:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿啊  我现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.55,0:25:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美  味  啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.85,0:25:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Famine?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.66,0:25:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.52,0:25:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  这整个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, this whole town
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.10,0:25:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就去狂吃  狂喝  然后就都撑死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is just gonna eat, drink, and screw itself to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得去阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.66,0:25:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  想法真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.14,0:25:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么阻止呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.90,0:25:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上一次遇见骑士时  你是怎么阻止他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you stop the last horseman you met?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.82,0:25:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争的魔咒在这个戒指里\N{\fnArial\fs30}War got his mojo from this ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.77,0:25:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他的手指切下后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after we cut it off,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.95,0:25:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就夹着尾巴逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he just tucked tail and ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.87,0:25:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些遭受饥荒影响的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everybody that was affected,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.23,0:25:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛是从梦中惊醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was like they woke up out of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.51,0:25:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为饥荒骑士也有个类似的戒指吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think famine's got a class ring, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.59,0:25:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.39,0:25:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.42,0:25:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去找到他  并把他的手指剁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's track him down and get to chopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.25,0:25:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了  变成汉堡神偷了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, the hamburglar?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:25:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(麦当劳动画人物  酷爱汉堡)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.82,0:25:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经喜欢上牛肉堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've developed a taste for ground beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.91,0:26:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有想过克制住呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have you even tried to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.86,0:26:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是天使  可以想停就停\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel. I can stop anytime I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想停就停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.55,0:26:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.12,0:26:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.21,0:26:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.06,0:26:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.50,0:26:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.47,0:26:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.84,0:26:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我已受饥荒影响了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it got to me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.22,0:26:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm hungry for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.69,0:26:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对什么产生饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.06,0:26:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.24,0:26:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔之血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.88,0:26:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.39,0:26:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得把他弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.22,0:26:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得把他送走  送去蒙大拿州吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to beam him to, like, Montana.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要离开这儿随便哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.37,0:26:38.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的  他已经被传染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work. He's already infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.31,0:26:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥饿感会在他全身蔓延\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunger is just gonna travel with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.14,0:26:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.25,0:26:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去把那个混蛋的手指砍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go cut that bastard's finger off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.41,0:26:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.94,0:26:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是...  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.53,0:26:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在离开前  你最好...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you go, you better...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.72,0:26:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好把我锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you better lock me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.97,0:27:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.86,0:27:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你在这儿等会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.14,0:27:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会尽快回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back as soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.05,0:27:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  快去快回\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.83,0:27:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  马蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.38,0:27:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔曼医生在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Dr. Corman around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还没听说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.81,0:27:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.69,0:27:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这20年来他一直都恪尽职守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy's been dry for the last 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.29,0:27:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可今天早上  他突然离开工作岗位 \N{\fnArial\fs30}But this morning, he left work, 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.84,0:28:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家以后  酗酒过量而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}went home, and drank himself to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是饥荒骑士  - 什么 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's famine.  - Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.69,0:28:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能容许我们单独聊会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give us a minute, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.76,0:28:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.29,0:28:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.05,0:28:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的有点喜欢上他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really kind of liked this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没有夺去他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't harvested his soul yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们想用"追魂法"抓住饥荒骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we want to play "Follow the soul" to get to famine,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.68,0:28:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最好从这名医生开始调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best shot starts with the doc, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.07,0:29:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.37,0:29:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}These make me...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.91,0:29:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我愉悦万分啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}...very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.82,0:29:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃了多少个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.21,0:29:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost count.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.72,0:29:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一两百个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the low hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.97,0:29:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I don't understand is...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.92,0:29:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你怎么会不饿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your hunger, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.88,0:29:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然进程缓慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, slowly but surely,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.32,0:29:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇上的人最终都会成为饥荒骑士的牺牲品\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone in this town is falling prey to famine,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可到目前为止你似乎丝毫未受影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}but so far, you seem unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.50,0:29:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我想喝的时候  我就喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, when I want to drink, I drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.30,0:29:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想做爱就做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I want sex, I go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.21,0:29:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于吃三明治和打架也是同理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same goes for a sandwich or a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.82,0:29:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.84,0:29:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你的适应能力强吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying you're just well-adjusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.63,0:29:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天  当然不是  我只是吃饱喝足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no. I'm just well-fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.39,0:30:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.77,0:30:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.11,0:30:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这样没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.47,0:30:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我还是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm still --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.46,0:30:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}...still hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.05,0:30:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.53,0:30:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人帮我们把你捆起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone trussed you up for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.37,0:30:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大说要留你活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss says we can't kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.33,0:30:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我想我们可以把你切成几块带给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but I bet we can break off a few pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.30,0:31:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没轮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.03,0:31:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.10,0:31:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要把计划再复习一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go over the plan again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.10,0:31:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(麦当劳儿童套餐)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.40,0:31:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开心乐园餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, happy meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.53,0:31:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.26,0:31:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿着刀进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take the knife, I go in,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.36,0:31:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把饥荒骑士戴戒指的手指砍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut off the ring hand of famine,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.93,0:31:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后返回停车场见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I meet you back here in the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.16,0:32:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听上去挺简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that sounds foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间太长了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is taking too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.30,0:32:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.40,0:33:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.26,0:33:21.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一位温彻斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other Mr. Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.91,0:33:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.64,0:33:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放狗咬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sicced your dog on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.77,0:33:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是赏他了一块骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just threw him a steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.62,0:33:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的了不起的招数\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is your big trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人们为可可泡芙发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making people cuckoo for cocoa puffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.70,0:33:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有费我多少神  只是助推了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't take much -- hardly a push.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国人一直都是"吃到饱"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, America -- all-you-can-eat, all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃啊  喝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consume, consume.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群穿肥裤子的蝗虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A swarm of locusts in stretch pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.54,0:33:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你们还是饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, you're all still starving
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.04,0:33:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为饿不仅仅来自于身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because hunger doesn't just come from the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.77,0:33:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还来自于灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It also comes from the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.80,0:34:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑  我的怎么就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny, it doesn't seem to be coming from mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.30,0:34:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.97,0:34:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you wondered why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.54,0:34:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我出现的地方  你怎么还能正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you could even walk in my presence?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.50,0:34:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I like to think
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.00,0:34:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是由于我的人格力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because of my strength of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.77,0:34:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.14,0:34:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.17,0:34:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.24,0:34:37.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里深邃  黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one deep, dark
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.61,0:34:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你心里什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing you got there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.96,0:34:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都放不进去  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't fill it, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.00,0:34:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是用食物或酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with food or drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.27,0:34:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至连性都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even with sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.97,0:34:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你满口废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're so full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以装傻  对你弟弟开玩笑  欺骗他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you can smirk and joke and lie to your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.60,0:34:58.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欺骗自己  但你骗不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie to yourself, but not to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.47,0:35:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我可以看见你的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see inside you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.87,0:35:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是多么的支离破碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}how broken you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.50,0:35:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多么的挫败\N{\fnArial\fs30}How defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.94,0:35:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赢不了  你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.80,0:35:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你还是坚持战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you just keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.47,0:35:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机械的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...keep going through the motions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.04,0:35:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不饿  迪恩  因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not hungry, dean, because inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.44,0:35:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're already...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.94,0:35:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.34,0:35:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.00,0:35:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.57,0:35:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.40,0:35:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁也不许动这个可爱的小男孩一根毫毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one lays a finger on this sweet little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.74,0:35:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你吃了我送你的点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I see you got the snack I sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.54,0:35:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.10,0:35:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  你和其他人不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. You're not like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.20,0:36:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会因为喝得太多而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never die from drinking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.10,0:36:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是一个例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the exception that proves the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.97,0:36:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.00,0:36:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要你成为那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan wanted you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.94,0:36:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.44,0:36:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,割开他们的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}...cut their throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.67,0:36:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,享用他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.54,0:36:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.14,0:36:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请把  不要客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.04,0:37:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.07,0:37:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.60,0:37:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你不要他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want them...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.44,0:37:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们就归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.57,0:37:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我是天启骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a horseman, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.19,0:37:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的能力对我不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your power doesn't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.41,0:37:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.07,0:37:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是对他们起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it will work on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.15,0:38:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  求你们啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.97,0:39:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在里面的那个人不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not him in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.54,0:39:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是真正的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.87,0:39:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.48,0:39:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  萨姆得从这个状态摆脱出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Sam just has to get it out of his system.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.04,0:39:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然他会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he'll be --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.64,0:39:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.48,0:39:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得出去透口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.54,0:40:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.47,0:40:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.40,0:40:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.14,0:40:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
